Source: facelock
Maintainer: sppidy <sppidytg@gmail.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: facelock
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-opencv, python3-numpy,
 python3-yaml, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, v4l-utils, libcamera-tools
Recommends: python3-libcamera
Suggests: python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, pkexec
Description: Howdy-style face login for libcamera/ISP and UVC cameras
 Face authentication for Linux rebuilt for machines where the camera is
 not a plain UVC webcam: libcamera/ISP sensors (e.g. Qualcomm CAMSS
 OV02C10 + HM1092 IR with flash illuminator) as well as ordinary USB
 webcams. CPU-only YuNet + SFace recognition, PAM integration with
 password fallback, per-machine profiles.
